## Conventions de nommage strictes

| Élément | Convention | Exemple |
|---|---|---|
| CSS custom property | `--color-{role}`, `--space-{n}` | `--color-bg-surface` |
| Classe CSS | BEM léger : `block__element--modifier` | `deck-zone__header--collapsed` |
| Attribut JS | `data-{module}-{action}` | `data-deck-action="add"` |
| Interface TS | PascalCase | `DeckCard`, `SearchResult` |
| Fonction TS | camelCase verbe | `addCardToDeck()` |
| Fichier TS | camelCase | `deckBuilder.ts` |
| Template Tera | kebab-case | `deck-zone.html.tera` |

